# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo (cross-platform consistency).
* text=auto eol=lf

# The okfignore fixture carries ONE CRLF-terminated pattern among LF ones, on
# purpose: 13 of the 15 estate bundles that now ship a .okfignore sit in repos
# that check dotfiles out as CRLF, and a binding that fails to strip the CR
# turns every pattern on such a line into one that matches nothing -- silently,
# because an ignore that does not fire just looks like errors coming back.
# eol=lf above would normalise that away and delete the test.
conformance/bundles/okfignore/.okfignore -text

*.png binary
*.duckdb binary
